# Whitelist approach: ignore everything at repo root, then re-include only
# the files that make up the tooling / static site / docs. Everything else
# in this working directory (source .txt lists, videos, images, DB, exe,
# unrelated scripts, __pycache__) is user-local and stays out of git.

/*

# Allow these files/dirs specifically.
!.gitignore
!README.md
!.thumb_cache.json
!LinksApp.spec
!audit_links.py
!build_links_page.py
!build_static.py
!fetch_thumbs.py
!move_to_bottom.py
!ph_solver.py
!server.py
!docs/
!site/
